        "content": "bb6f8ca chore: update ralph loop.sh with the false-clean-pass fix\nd26de3b docs: close two gaps in README against shipped behaviour\nab3a9fd fix: document --header as name=value and execute the doc's examples\nbc9bbdc fix: make a command group named without a subcommand exit 2\n5aa07bf fix: give history entries a stable id so replay names one entry\n94a68c3 fix: cancel curl on a signal instead of orphaning it\n8f678cd fix: redact response bodies that are arrays or contain arrays\nfeff402 fix: apply redact.headers to the displayed request, not just history\nc2a2486 fix: reject credentials in a base URL's userinfo\n1448978 fix: never echo a rejected name=value flag's value, reject bad header names\nb26ec2b fix: pass curl -q so ~/.curlrc cannot capture the credential\nb0c7c90 review-plan: 9 tasks from 9 CRIT findings\n854166a review: 35 findings (9 CRIT)\n4cde768 docs: note the http/https base-URL restriction in AGENT.md\na4f61a8 fix: keep libopenapi's diagnostics off stdout\nf747586 fix: exit 2 on an unknown command and render version through the envelope\n146dd1c fix: keep non-UTF-8 bodies in the corpus and refuse lossy replays\nf176666 fix: send run's generated body under the media type it was generated from\ne0cceae fix: serialise history appends so trim cannot destroy entries\n828ade8 fix: bound the curl subprocess with connect and total timeouts\n2d92e67 fix: emit correct curl for HEAD and match the rendered body flag to the wire\n6438de5 fix: restrict base URLs and curl to http and https\nfeb60d8 fix: redact credentials passed in the query string\nfb90ced review-plan: 9 tasks from 11 CRIT findings\nb5afc96 review: 20 findings (11 CRIT)\n966a77e ci: build, lint and test on push and pull request\n9f646b4 test: end-to-end integration across the whole loop\n74d2556 feat: JUnit report output for `talaria run`\nab447ef feat: `talaria run` — smoke testing\nd96711d feat: fixtures and the test-data priority chain\n5691b19 feat: internal/gen — schema-based data generation\nc13ba05 feat: the `call` validation block and `--fail-on-error`\n788735a feat: internal/validate — response-vs-spec validation\nfc84f03 feat: AGENT.md v1 — the operating manual for agents\ned7158a feat: the canary-secret leak suite\nd046369 feat: `talaria history` — list, show, replay\n91af88f feat: internal/corpus — the redacted history store\n73f2064 feat: `talaria auth check` and the exit-code-5 contract\n514a717 feat: response redaction and the query-string key warning\n7deb4cf feat: `talaria call` — real execution\na94448d feat: internal/request — request bodies from flag, file, and stdin\nf32cacc feat: internal/curl — the curl executor and version preflight\n125b972 feat: internal/curl — the `curl -K -` config document builder\n6af3103 feat: symbolic curl rendering, `call --dry-run`, and mutation gating\n783de65 feat: internal/request — parameter binding and the symbolic Request\n2a340af feat: internal/config — profiles and env-var auth mapping\n6cf5328 feat: internal/secret — SecretRef and the credential firewall\n61fac96 feat: talaria search and talaria uses\n6046439 feat: talaria describe and the compact schema renderer\nb8794f3 feat: talaria list\n---STAT---\n cmd/talaria/auth.go              | 202 +++++++++++\n cmd/talaria/call.go              | 548 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n cmd/talaria/describe.go          | 284 ++++++++++++++++\n cmd/talaria/history.go           | 702 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n cmd/talaria/list.go              | 192 +++++++++++\n cmd/talaria/main.go              |   9 +\n cmd/talaria/root.go              | 236 +++++++++++++\n cmd/talaria/run.go               | 606 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n cmd/talaria/search.go            |  73 ++++\n cmd/talaria/uses.go              |  74 +++++\n cmd/talaria/version.go           |  35 ++\n internal/canary/surfaces.go      | 176 ++++++++++\n internal/clierr/clierr.go        | 150 +++++++++\n internal/config/auth.go          | 316 ++++++++++++++++++\n