        "type": "tool_result",
        "content": "7:> `talaria search`, `talaria uses`, `talaria call`, `talaria auth check`,\n8:> `talaria history` and `talaria run` work so far; the rest of the command tree is scaffolded.\n55:talaria list https://petstore3.swagger.io/api/v3/openapi.json\n56:talaria list ./openapi.yaml --tag pets\n71:talaria describe ./openapi.yaml getPet\n72:talaria describe getPet --spec ./openapi.yaml --depth 2\n115:talaria search ./openapi.yaml invoice\n116:talaria search ./openapi.yaml invoice --kind schema\n137:talaria uses ./openapi.yaml Pet\n231:talaria auth check ./openapi.yaml\n232:talaria auth check ./openapi.yaml --profile staging --output json\n251:talaria cannot supply at all (OAuth2, OpenID Connect) are left out rather than reported missing.\n258:talaria call ./openapi.yaml getPet --param petId=42 --query verbose=true\n363:talaria history\n364:talaria history --operation getPet --since 1h --status 4xx\n365:talaria history show 3\n366:talaria history replay 3\n394:talaria processes can share one history file: each append takes an exclusive advisory lock on\n396:talaria reported as recorded is one you will find in the file.\n408:TALARIA_HISTORY=off talaria call ./openapi.yaml getPet --param petId=42\n422:talaria run ./openapi.yaml --base-url http://localhost:9000\n423:talaria run ./openapi.yaml --tag pets --operation getPet --fail-on-error\n424:talaria run ./openapi.yaml --fixtures ./fixtures --allow-mutations --report json\n458:talaria run ./openapi.yaml --base-url \"$STAGING\" --report junit > report.xml",
        "is_error": false
      }
    ]
