        "content": "=== list ===\nFlags:\n  -h, --help         help for list\n      --tag string   only operations carrying this tag\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --base-url string   override the spec's server URL\n      --output string     output format: json|pretty|tsv (default: pretty on a terminal, json when piped)\n      --profile string    named profile from the config file: base-url + headers + auth\n      --spec string       OpenAPI/Swagger spec to use: file path or URL (default: $TALARIA_SPEC)\n=== describe ===\nFlags:\n      --depth int   how many levels of nested schema to render before truncating (default 6)\n  -h, --help        help for describe\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --base-url string   override the spec's server URL\n      --output string     output format: json|pretty|tsv (default: pretty on a terminal, json when piped)\n      --profile string    named profile from the config file: base-url + headers + auth\n      --spec string       OpenAPI/Swagger spec to use: file path or URL (default: $TALARIA_SPEC)\n=== search ===\nFlags:\n  -h, --help          help for search\n      --kind string   restrict results to one kind: operation|schema|param (default: all three)\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --base-url string   override the spec's server URL\n      --output string     output format: json|pretty|tsv (default: pretty on a terminal, json when piped)\n      --profile string    named profile from the config file: base-url + headers + auth\n      --spec string       OpenAPI/Swagger spec to use: file path or URL (default: $TALARIA_SPEC)\n=== uses ===\nFlags:\n  -h, --help   help for uses\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --base-url string   override the spec's server URL\n      --output string     output format: json|pretty|tsv (default: pretty on a terminal, json when piped)\n      --profile string    named profile from the config file: base-url + headers + auth\n      --spec string       OpenAPI/Swagger spec to use: file path or URL (default: $TALARIA_SPEC)\n=== history ===\nFl